#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Definition]
#title[Exponential Generating Type]

Given a species $F$ define the exponential generating type (at the finite set $X$) as 
$
  sum_(A : "FinSet") F(A) xx (A-> X)
$

TODO : it is isomorphic to
$
  sum_(n : NN) (F([n]) xx X^n) slash.double S_n
$

Compare #local("00G5")[From Finite Sets to Feynman Diagrams].
